OEM/ODM name: Sercomm S3 CQR. 

The Beeline SmartBox TURBO+  is a CPE wireless router based on the MT7621 platform is supplied by the Beeline provider on the territory of the Russian Federation. Made by OEM/ODM Sercomm on S3 platform (Beeline SmartBox TURBO, Etisalat Sercomm S3, Rostelecom RT-SF-1). Gigabit router with 802.11ac, MIMO 4x4 and ZigBee. It is easy to buy on the secondary market at a low price in the Russian Federation.


